WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.940
It is useless.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.940
I am this very world,
a sword cannot cut me down.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.190
Then, I'll just have
to destroy the entire world.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.990
Sword, use it!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:12.990
Yeah!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.920
Golden Knight.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.920
I don't want anyone else to die.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.050
So please lend me power!

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.220
I want to protect Sword! Everyone!

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.710
I missed the gate because of you.

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.130
What're you going to do about this, huh?

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:19.090
The contract I had with the ring is now gone.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:27.060
So, now, I am here, free from orders
and of my own volition!

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:31.410
My very soul existed for this very moment!

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:36.000
Let us settle this once
and for all, Golden Knight!

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.950
Damn, until the very end...

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.140
Guess I'll just have to teach you...

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.340
What real strength is.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:43.070
Gina. Luke.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.870
Sophie. You did well.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.240
Yeah, thanks.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.920
So, what about Sword?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.960
Where is Sword?

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.240
What a waste

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.780
With that much strength,
we could've faced Makai itself

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.860
and destroyed all Horrors from the source!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.890
Such a waste.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:11.830
With your strength,
you could have carved your name

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:18.040
amongst the strongest of all time.
For all eternity!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.280
My strength is not for myself.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:12.180
My entire being is for those
who cannot fight for themselves.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:16.560
As well as for stopping people like you!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.600
Golden Knight!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.960
It was a good battle.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.000
I had fun,

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.490
Golden Knight!

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.610
Hey, where's Sword?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.390
Why? Why hasn't Sword come back yet?!

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.770
Hey, Gina!

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.270
Hey, Luke!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:46.020
Gina! Answer me!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:57.640
No! No! Let me go! Let me go! Sword!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.540
Sword!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.660
Sword is still there!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:09.510
I have to go back! I have to go back!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.260
I have to save Sword!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.340
L-Luke...

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:35.770
Sword asked me to do
this after everything was over.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:46.140
Hey, Gina. Stop! Stop!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.580
Please!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.070
Good-bye, Sophie.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.000
Gina!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:05.120
A year has passed since
the hurricane devastated Russell City

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.080
and the pace of reconstruction
has continued to increase.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:12.060
Regarding the simultaneous
world-wide network compromise,

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.150
official reports have been released...

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.720
Mr. Brooks!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.100
How is everyone doing?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.060
What's with all that stuff?!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:32.020
Early Christmas presents for good children!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.490
Sophie! Mr. Brooks brought us presents!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:39.540
Sophie!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.910
Yeah. I'm coming.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:53.470
Everyone in the neighborhood
pitched in. It's not much, but...

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:59.060
About the new administrator for this facility...

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.250
A decision is finally being made.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.850
Really? Thank goodness...

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.620
The church will contact us tomorrow.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:12.350
Sorry for making you all anxious all year.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:14.680
No, it's fine.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.940
It's lonely without Sister,

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:23.450
but we can overcome
anything if we work together.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.420
Everyone has helped us so much.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:30.780
Since you're the oldest,
it must have been tough on you.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.430
I'm fine.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.580
My brother is watching over me.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.680
Four years ago, my brother died in an accident.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:49.280
And Sister, who helped
me get through that pain,

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:50.990
is no longer here.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:55.690
But I still have all the memories right here.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.040
Sophie is spacing out again.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.130
I'm not!

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.760
Did you get a new crush? Who?

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.010
That's not it.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:25.430
Hey, who is it! Could it be Andrew?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.930
I'm telling you, it's not!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.930
From now on, with everyone,

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.650
I want to keep making new memories.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:43.110
Hey. I still think it was better
to call and get it delivered.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:47.070
We won't be able to carry all of this.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:52.450
The restaurants are busy because
of Christmas. Don't act like a brat.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:58.420
Hey, I wonder what we're having tonight?
I want to eat meat!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:03.220
I'm sick of cod stew.
I want to eat some beef steak!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.210
Right, Sophie?

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.250
Sophie, are you listening?

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:10.810
Hey, Sophie.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:17.560
Hm?

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.110
It's gotta be Andrew.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.140
It's not!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:26.510
Wait!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:31.410
Hey, Sophie. We should
have beef steak for dinner.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.000
No, we're having cod stew.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.500
What?!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.330
I have everyone here with me.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:05.950
I have people watching over us
as well as family I need to care for.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.740
So, I'm fine.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.230
But, I wonder why.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:27.500
I feel like I've lost something.
Something very important.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.900
S-Sophie, I'm sorry.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.850
Don't play in a place like this!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:52.300
Go clean your rooms properly!

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.730
Okay!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.020
Ouch!

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:30.860
What is it, Sophie?

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.820
Sophie, what's wrong?

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.910
It's here! For sure! Somewhere!

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.040
You looking for something? What is it?

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.620
S-Sophie?

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:06.230
What's that? A pendant?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:11.750
Sophie?!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:38.690
Are you okay?

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:01.430
Sorry!

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:03.790
Sorry!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.630
That I didn't remember you...

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.170
I'm sorry...

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.310
...Sword!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.900
Welcome!

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.590
Gina.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:51.750
Oh, my. So, you remembered after all,

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:53.150
Sophie.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.930
Thanks for waiting!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.890
Take your time!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:12.900
Looks like Luke's "rain" couldn't
beat the power that saved the world.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:16.800
Are you sure?

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:26.320
Your feelings within that stone is
what made you recall your memories.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.710
But, if the current you
can't handle those memories...

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.290
Is Sword okay?

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.300
The Golden Knight doesn't die.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:39.260
Not by something like that.

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:45.890
He's fine. He's great.
Though he's out right now.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:52.230
Thank goodness. Thank goodness!

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:03.290
Gina, tell me something.

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:04.160
Hm?

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:09.080
How do you become a Makai Alchemist?

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:15.150
I know that you all erased
my memories for my sake.

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.820
It hurts. Really bad.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:23.310
All the things I've done can never be undone.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.510
But... But...

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.270
I don't want to turn it all into an illusion!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:41.490
I don't know what I can do
or even if I can really do it.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:46.700
But, if I can protect even one
more person from becoming like me...!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:52.360
I'm sure the memories of
my brother will live within me.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.170
I will definitely become stronger.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.870
I'll become stronger and meet Sword again.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:02.590
So, you've decided.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:04.680
Yes.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:06.850
Thanks for waiting!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.980
Per the boss, this is on the house!

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.060
Whoa!

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:18.080
If that's the case,
please continue your patronage here.

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.870
Table two, chili shrimp and five egg <i>yakisoba</i>!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.720
Where table six sticky rice dumpling?!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.330
<i>Aiya</i>, we forgot.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.910
Hurry! Jeez!

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:42.780
You hurry, too! That table four, right?! Jeez.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.180
Oh. Sorry about that.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:47.800
Goodness!

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:54.810
Jeez! Lately it's peaceful
so everyone getting so lazy!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.690
Peace reigns the land. A good thing.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:02.570
He better not become lazy
with his one-man journey.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:08.910
Him again? You really took a liking to him.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:16.670
I'm going to clean here! Grandpa go home!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.170
That Meifang.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:58.390
Lately she's been so prickly.
What happened to her?!

00:21:58.880 --> 00:21:59.540
Right?

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.370
I agree.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:11.640
You've gotten old.

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:14.310
Makai Alchemist Fei Long.

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:17.980
Did you prepare some good booze?

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.650
Looks like it's going to be a fun night tonight.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:37.650
Truly, a splendid pile of trash.

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:42.710
You were able to go all out,
so I'm sure you're pretty satisfied.

00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:52.390
Well, then. I haven't been free in a while.

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:55.830
Where should I go play?

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:04.110
Thank you very much!

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:07.080
Did the flavor of your hamburgers drop?

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:09.860
What is that boss of yours doing?!

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:11.450
Thank you very much!

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:14.580
Sophie, let's go.

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:15.680
Yeah.

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:22.580
Wait for me, Sword.

00:23:23.970 --> 00:23:26.650
I'll definitely go and see you someday.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:37.220
That boss...

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.040
They used me to test a new menu item!

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:41.500
Hm?

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:43.160
Hm?

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:52.870
Excuse me.
